# P4 (ref/ff-imx-port-plan.md): the Project Settings page on the Tracker+ and Mini sims, which have no plugin host. File screen, F7 opens it: the
# rows of project.mtff (4 FX Slots, Strum volume, Random seed, Reroll seed, Scale snap), no Stereo pairs row (stereo pairs are MK66 only).
# Replay: bun replay.ts synth-open/tools/ui_shot/flows/mini_only_project_settings.flow --target sim --model mini --offline --ui <ui_shot> (plus_flows.sh)
# Mini (P8): no File key, Menu box 6 (Down, Right x2 from the Pattern box) opens File, F7 is Project Settings.
title: Project Settings page on the Mini (P8)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Down
wait 200ms
tap Right x2
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
tap F7
wait 1000ms
expect text "4 FX Slots"
shot proj-settings
expect peek fxslots 2
tap F8
wait 600ms
tap Down
wait 600ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
shot proj-4fx-on
expect peek fxslots 4
